1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,160
Zhi An

3
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,640
Our misunderstanding is finally cleared up

4
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,320
I was wrong before

5
00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:00,520
I only thought about fulfilling Seventh Brother's feelings for you

6
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,320
But I never expected

7
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,040
He harbored evil intentions

8
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,280
Rest assured

9
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,200
I've already killed him

10
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,240
I will avenge the Li family

11
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,520
Tell me where the Dragon Jade is

12
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:19,320
He's dead

13
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:24,640
Those who betray me must die

14
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,280
No, impossible

15
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,200
How could he die

16
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,240
Zhu Huaichen must be lying to me

17
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:32,920
What's wrong

18
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,040
Don't tell me you've developed feelings for him

19
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,800
He deceived me before

20
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,560
Of course I wouldn't develop feelings for him

21
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,440
But you've deceived me too

22
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,720
So

23
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,600
I can no longer place my complete trust in you

24
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:50,240
If you truly wish to avenge our Li family

25
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,040
Then take me to meet the remaining members of the Li clan

26
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,000
Otherwise

27
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:56,520
I would rather take the Dragon Jade to the underworld to meet my parents

28
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,240
Than surrender it easily

29
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:06,720
Zhi An, remember that I'm the only one you can truly trust

30
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:10,880
Tomorrow, I'll take you to meet the remaining Li family members

31
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,400
Zhi An

32
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:26,760
Third Prince

33
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,680
Have our Li family's remaining members arrived?

34
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,120
Young Mistress

35
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,720
I've finally been able to see you

36
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,880
Uncle Chen, it's you

37
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,720
Are you all doing well?

38
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,080
We're all doing fine

39
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:52,240
The Third Prince has kept us in a safe location

40
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:54,960
Now we're just waiting to avenge our Li family

41
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:59,960
Wait, why is he showing such respect to Zhu Huaichen?

42
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:01,120
Could it be...

43
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,400
I've been wondering all along

44
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,320
The Li family has been loyal and brave for generations

45
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,640
How could they be so easily wiped out?

46
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,640
There must have been a traitor among us

47
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:14,240
Uncle Chen, how could it be you?

48
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,720
I can't let you two collude together

49
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:21,480
Uncle Chen, I must avenge the Li family

50
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:25,880
But I truly don't know the exact location of the Dragon Jade treasure

51
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:29,440
You were sworn brothers with my father

52
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:32,280
You must have clues that you'd tell the Third Prince

53
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:38,440
I... I never heard your father mention it before

54
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:41,080
This concerns our revenge plan

55
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:44,200
Please don't hide anything from the Third Prince

56
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:47,240
Nor think of using it to maintain your military power

57
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,560
Although the Li family is now wronged

58
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:53,920
Our name will be cleared one day

59
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:57,400
Then you'll still be the backbone of the Li army

60
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,040
Don't use the wrong methods

61
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,800
What else are you hiding from me?

62
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,360
Nothing

63
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:15,000
Third Prince, you must believe me

64
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:18,200
If... if I really knew any clues about the Dragon Jade treasure...

65
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,400
That Li fellow treats his daughter like a priceless treasure

66
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,840
Always saying Li Zhi'an is the real gem

67
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,880
Does this count?

68
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,640
If you would grant me Zhi'an's hand in marriage

69
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,760
I promise to cherish her with all my heart

70
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:40,320
Zhi'an is the apple of our Li family's eye

71
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,520
Originally, as a mere hostage from Nanliang

72
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,280
You wouldn't be worthy of her in any way

73
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,760
But she's completely smitten

74
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,760
Insisting on marrying you

75
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,040
I warn you

76
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,760
If you mistreat her

77
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,280
Our Li family won't take it lying down

78
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,800
No matter if you're royalty or nobility

79
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:02,040
But if you two live in harmony

80
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:06,760
You'll discover what a precious treasure she truly is

81
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:07,880
I understand

82
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,600
I'll treasure her like the rarest jewel

83
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,200
And love her all my life

84
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,800
A blind man

85
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,640
Actually treating her like treasure

86
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,760
Could it be

87
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:28,000
The Dragon Jade treasure map is on Li Zhi'an

88
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,760
Is Zhu Huaijin really dead?

89
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,480
How could he die?

90
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,320
He's a reborn person like me

91
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,560
He should have been able to avoid all dangers

92
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:41,920
Why?

93
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,360
Is it because I knocked him unconscious?

94
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,560
Zhi'an

95
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,760
Still awake so late?

96
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,920
Thinking about me?

97
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,080
What brings you here?

98
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,520
I've discovered the location of the Dragon Jade treasure

99
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:10,680
Really?

100
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,400
Where is it?

101
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,760
Don't you know?

102
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,440
The Dragon Jade treasure

103
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,560
Is on you

104
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,960
You are the Dragon Jade treasure

105
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,240
I guessed right

106
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,600
The Dragon Jade treasure is on you

107
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,560
Where exactly is it?

108
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,200
Where exactly is it?

109
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,320
Li Zhi'an

110
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:50,360
The Dragon Jade is on you, isn't it?

111
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,400
It's not

112
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,200
The Dragon Jade I've been searching for so long

113
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,200
It's not here

114
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,440
Both the Dragon Jade and you will belong to me

115
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,440
It's not here

116
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,040
Li Zhi'an

117
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,200
What a cunning scheme

118
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:02,720
It's not here

119
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,240
Li Zhi'an, I've decided you're mine

120
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:11,520
Li Zhi'an

121
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:19,040
Li Zhi'an, where are you going?

122
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,360
Zhi'an

123
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,800
Zhu Huaijin

124
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,000
Zhu Huaijin

125
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,080
You're actually alive!

126
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:44,600
And you, Li Zhi'an - you're not blind!

127
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,760
Zhi'an

128
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,720
If I were to go blind

129
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:52,040
how could I see through this vicious person

130
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:54,000
You've been deceiving me all along

131
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,080
Watch out

132
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,360
Guards

133
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,720
Huamei, take her away

134
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,360
Let me take you somewhere first

135
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,800
No, we can't leave him alone here

136
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,520
Huamei

137
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,400
Huamei

138
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,120
Your Highness, you're finally awake

139
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,600
Huamei, where is this

140
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,840
Where's Zhu Huaijin

141
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,600
This is Huamei's mother's residence

142
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,960
Huamei told me you weren't blind

143
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,800
I didn't believe it at first

144
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,040
This is truly wonderful

145
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,080
As for the Seventh Prince

146
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,360
The Seventh Prince is in Zhu Huaichen's hands

147
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,880
We must rescue him immediately

148
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,400
First come with me to another place

149
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,840
The Seventh Prince instructed

150
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,760
If one day you come here

151
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:13,680
Whether he's present or not

152
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,280
He wanted you to go inside and see

153
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,640
He's actually been maintaining

154
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:36,240
The memorial tablets of my Li family's slaughtered relatives

155
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,600
Could it be

156
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:41,040
Everything he did was to avenge me

157
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,760
He loved and protected me

158
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,600
Wanting to keep me away from conflicts

159
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:49,160
Now he's fallen into a fatal situation for my sake

160
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,320
How could anyone be so foolish

161
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,920
Why aren't there tablets for my parents

162
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,800
Father

163
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,280
Mother

164
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,200
You're still alive

165
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,120
Zhi'an, it's you

166
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:43,160
Can your eyes see now

167
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:51,520
Your mother and I had been unconscious

168
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:54,960
Fortunately, the Seventh Prince arranged caretakers

169
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:58,520
And found ways to save us during the crisis

170
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,560
You are the benefactor of our Li family

171
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,320
Father

172
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,600
Zhi'an's blood feud

173
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,600
must be avenged

174
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,760
This is our Li family's tiger tally

175
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,000
Every soldier in the Li army recognizes it

176
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:17,080
All must obey its bearer's commands

177
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:20,760
Though the Seventh Prince rescued and sheltered us both

178
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,120
there are traitors within the Li army

179
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:27,120
And with Zhu Huaichen commanding these troops

180
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,360
he will surely rebel

181
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,600
My son, take this tiger tally

182
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:33,400
Reveal it at the critical moment

183
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,120
The Li army will know what to do

184
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,440
How is Zhu Huaijin?

185
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,520
So you weren't really blind

186
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:53,080
This isn't the time for that

187
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:56,160
Zhu Huaichen has taken the Seventh Prince hostage

188
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:58,760
demanding your Dragon Jade treasure map in exchange

189
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,000
for his release

190
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,040
But if Zhu Huaichen obtains the Dragon Jade

191
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,320
with his ambition

192
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,720
he'll immediately raise troops in rebellion

193
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,840
Should he ascend the throne

194
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,200
his ambition would drive him to attack Northern Jin

195
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:11,760
And then

196
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:14,080
all the common people would suffer

197
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,240
I believe if the Seventh Prince were here

198
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,360
he'd rather die

199
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:21,200
than let you surrender the Dragon Jade

200
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,320
Zhi'an

201
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,440
We must save the Seventh Prince
